      "message": "This looks mostly fine. Can we have a more end-to-end test ? Maybe hostsideVpnTest could do something, or some of the VpnManager tests, or even in ConnectivityServiceTest. The idea would be to make sure that\n• when the VPN is sending a new list of networks, NC callbacks are called and the object contains them\n• when a VPN doesn\u0027t declare underlying networks but the default network changes, NC callbacks are called and the object contains the default network as underlying\n",
