      "message": "```\nTo implement this, I think we can have a boolean defined in NetworkAgentInfo to record if this network\u0027s underlying networks should follow the system default network.\nWhenever the system default network is changed, this network\u0027s underlying network should also change.\n```\nIn fact, we don\u0027t need an extra boolean var, we can use NetworkAgentInfo#declaredUnderlyingNetworks directly.\nIf declaredUnderlyingNetworks is null, it means that the underlying networks of this network should follow the system default network.",
